  "note": "(1.22) ≤ (1.23) is equivalent to Lemma 4.1.2 plus the first bound of Lemma 4.1.3: min(A, B/s, C/s²) is at most each two-term minimum, and letting B or A → ∞ recovers the lemmas. Lean proves both lemmas but never states the three-term form."
